  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Formulation of Denmark&apos;s WPS NAP 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The office for Migration, Peace and Stabilisation (MIGSTAB) wishes to engage a consultant to assist with the formulation of Denmark&#x2019;s (interministerial) National Action Plan (NAP) on Women, Peace and Security for 2025-2029. The unit will lead on the coordination with other ministeries, civil society etc. but the consultant will support the unit in the drafting process and ensuring recommendations from evaluations from previous NAP&apos;s are taken into consideration. The NAP will strengthen efforts for the full, equal and meaningful participation of women in the work for peace and security &#x2013; both nationally and internationally.</narrative>
  </description>
